WEBVTT

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:04.380
Good morning.

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:08.210
It might be Sunday, but you slept in way too late.

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:10.550
We didn't even bother waiting for you before eating.

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:11.400
Sorry.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:16.560
Still in shock over yesterday's ParaPri?

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:18.690
A bit.

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:23.410
You did your best. No point in moping.

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:25.470
Sure.

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:28.340
It's hard to believe it's been a whole day since that ParaPri.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:32.050
We're starting the press conference with its winner, Falulu!

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:36.300
She's wearing the Paradise Coord!

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.720
You put on a wonderful performance yesterday.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:43.620
Thank you! But Falulu isn't even close to being done yet!

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:44.920
And what might you mean by that?

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:55.970
Did you know the Paradise Coord is said to glow when a true idol is born?

00:00:55.970 --> 00:00:58.070
And at our Paradise Coord debut concert tomorrow,

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:02.290
Falulu will proudly display this to you.

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:40.940
Thanks.

00:02:40.940 --> 00:02:43.010
Falulu was so amazing!

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:44.050
Yeah.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.020
Bad news-kuma!

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:53.980
Mireille and Sophie said they're not participating in this weekends concerts-kuma!

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.380
What?

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:58.030
It must be because of yesterday's defeat-kuma!

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:02.660
You probably don't have anything going on, so I want you to go check on those two-kuma.

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:04.330
Okay, I'll go!

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:08.540
Where's your "capisce"?

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:09.970
Oh, yeah...

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:14.060
Guess I'll go check up on those two.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.000
See you later, be careful.

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:18.320
Roger!

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:22.710
She's forgotten "capisce"!

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:26.060
She's acting totally weird.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:33.100
You're not coming to the show? But you can't skip it!

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:38.360
The numbers are unambiguous. Even if we performed now, we'd have no chance of winning.

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:40.480
So I'm staying home.

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:44.120
But how can we be sure before trying?

00:03:44.630 --> 00:03:45.850
Take a look a this.

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:50.470
The likelihood of SoLaMi SMILE beating Falulu.

00:03:50.470 --> 00:03:53.610
A whopping 0.001%.

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:56.460
In other words, we can't beat Falulu.

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:59.820
But if we practice tons, one of these days...

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:01.220
I've simulated that scenario.

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:04.470
88?

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:08.080
We'd need 88 hours of practice per day to catch up.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:10.120
Uh, err...

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:12.660
A day only has 24 hours, right?

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:17.920
Yes. Basically, no amount of practice would allow us to beat Falulu.

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:22.400
Is it any wonder I don't care to get on stage?

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.890
B-But...

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:25.820
Mireille is a calculated idol!

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:29.640
The fans don't want to see me keep losing!

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:31.240
S-Sure...

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.460
Pshu...

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:37.820
She was so hyped up for ParaPri.

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:41.160
Losing made it all blow away at once.

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:46.360
Might take a while to get back on track when she gets like that.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:48.130
Pshu...

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:49.330
Sophie...

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:53.490
Minami's lost her confidence...

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:56.350
And Sophie's run out of juice.

00:04:56.830 --> 00:05:00.050
SoLaMi SMILE could be in big trouble.

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:01.820
I've had enough!

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:03.120
Unforgivable!

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:04.280
What's up with that?

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:06.540
Is that even allowed?

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:08.290
All she did was copy everyone else!

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:10.450
How dare she "Fly, balloons."

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:11.390
Lala!

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:13.140
That's ours, damn it!

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:13.240
H-Hello.

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:15.190
I seriously can't believe it!

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:15.450
Ahh, I hate it!

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:17.380
Oknomiyaki's just about done.

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:18.020
Rage max! Fury max! Mad max!

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:19.010
Want some?

00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:20.880
Ah, thank you.

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:23.090
That copycat-plagiarist!

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.090
You call that winning?

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:28.660
Exciting Present For You!

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:30.220
She stole the Making Dramas we worked our butts off to make!

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:33.770
Fresh Sweets Park!

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:34.860
She stole the Making Dramas we worked our butts off to make!

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:36.570
So unfair!

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:39.690
Liberation Maiden Valkyria!

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:43.940
Stereo Full Blast 2-3 Rock!

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:46.200
Full-speed Dash!

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:48.260
Fly, Balloons!

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:57.260
Go has a strategy called mirror go, where you mirror your opponent's every move.

00:05:57.260 --> 00:05:58.520
Utterly absurd.

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:00.840
A real battle needs no underhandedness.

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:04.940
No matter how hard we work, Falulu's just gonna copy us!

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:09.890
I've decided. As long as Falulu's there, I'm not going back to PriPara.

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:10.440
Falulu's an idiot! And a coward!

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:11.470
Dorothy...

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:14.180
<i>I guess everyone is pretty shocked.</i>

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:17.140
So how'd it go-kuma?

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:21.570
Might be for the best if they both put the shows on hold for now.

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:23.070
Whaddya saying-kuma?

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:27.090
If they don't come back soon, their futures in the business and my wages are both looking real bad-kuma!

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:29.740
Well, I've gotta get to dinner now, so...

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:31.060
If they don't come back soon, their futures in the business and my wages are both looking real bad-kuma!

00:06:33.010 --> 00:06:35.940
What, you're not coming to PriPara for now?

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:38.150
You can't... Ah, ahhh!

00:06:38.150 --> 00:06:39.550
Cut off-usa!

00:06:39.550 --> 00:06:42.580
You in hiatus trouble too-kuma?

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:45.390
Could it be... You too-usa?

00:06:45.390 --> 00:06:46.800
Kuma kuma...

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:51.640
It's just a little loss!

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:52.890
Usa!

00:06:53.290 --> 00:06:58.850
But with how hard they were working for that Paradise Coord-usa...

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:01.460
It's no wonder they're feeling down-kuma.

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:08.440
But no shows for a while means all the less dedicated fans are leaving-usa...

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:12.700
What should I do-kuma?

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:13.290
Hey!

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:15.490
Holy snot! Keep away-usa!

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:18.030
Tell me what to do!

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:20.330
Morning!

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:24.290
What?! I'm not even late! Why?

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:26.480
Article 26:

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:29.060
No coming to school with bed head.

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:30.130
Bed head?

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:33.140
There's a strand out of place.

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:34.970
Just one?

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:36.640
Rules are rules.

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:41.940
She's ticketed pretty much everyone today.

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:43.770
Amamiya?

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:46.480
She's clearly overdoing it today.

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:49.620
I am ever her stalwart supporter.

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:52.590
If she is a beautiful rose, I am fertilizer.

00:07:52.590 --> 00:07:55.500
If she is a pearl, I am the muscles of her clam.

00:07:55.500 --> 00:08:00.600
But to my chagrin, I can't always stay by her side.

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:03.470
As such, Lala. I mean Miss Manaka!

00:08:03.470 --> 00:08:04.710
Y-Yes?

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:10.930
Please help me support her so she can return to the usual Minami as soon as possible!

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:12.430
Uh, sure!

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:14.130
Farewell!

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:17.040
Morning, Lala!

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:18.000
Nao!

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:22.610
You cried a little last night, didn't you?

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:23.350
Huh?

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:26.240
How'd you know?

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:27.560
We're best friends!

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:28.730
As Nao as ever.

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:32.340
No point being depressed about that loss.

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:37.240
Win or lose, I'm a fan of SoLaMi SMILE.

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:39.870
Chin up, Lala!

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:42.620
Thanks, Nao!

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:46.200
Come on! Isn't that a "capisce" moment?

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:48.170
Oh, right...

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:51.300
I thought I was doing pretty okay,

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:54.380
but maybe I <i>am</i> feeling depressed.

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:06.430
Excuse me.

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:08.230
Enter.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:10.690
Huh?

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:12.800
Everyone's here?

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:14.110
Silence!

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:18.100
Well then. The reason I've called you here...

00:09:18.630 --> 00:09:23.580
Just what is with your attitudes today?

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:27.540
Minami has been issuing warning tickets left and right.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:31.000
Houjou has been spotted jellified all over the place.

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:35.930
Toudou spends every break doing practice swings with her shinai!

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:39.430
And finally, Dorothy...

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:43.280
As you can see, I'm not sure where to even begin.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:43.960
You lookin' for a fight?

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:44.970
And Leona, you're no better, taking orders from her!

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:46.590
Come get some!

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:48.150
And Leona, you're no better, taking orders from her!

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:50.230
What about me?

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:52.950
The sin of having forgotten "capisce"!

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:54.360
Ehh?

00:09:54.360 --> 00:10:00.950
It's just one show! I'm stunned you could lose your way so easily!

00:10:02.090 --> 00:10:11.460
You were so ardently passionate about making me remember how much fun PriPara is.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:17.090
Where has your passion for PriPara disappeared to?

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:24.140
And I have another thing to tell you.

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:28.530
Meganii is bedridden with a dreadful stomach pain!

00:10:28.530 --> 00:10:28.980
What?!

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:30.940
Take a look at this!

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:35.290
My fleeting existence was so like this rose...

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:39.340
And when these last petals fall off...

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:41.050
So, too, shall my life...

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:49.850
If only I could have... seen SoLaMi SMILE and Dressing Pafé... one last time...

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:52.270
Meganii!

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:54.930
What a tragic sight!

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:57.380
Go visit him at once!

00:10:57.690 --> 00:10:58.800
Right away, ma'am!

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:00.470
I'll wait for you.

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.400
Mr. Meganii, are you all right?

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:20.320
Hey there, welcome.

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:22.820
Uhh...

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:24.330
What about the stomach pain?

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:26.790
Sorry for tricking you.

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:30.250
As you can see

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:34.050
I'm the same healthy, stylish tough guy as ever.

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:36.520
What a relief!

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:39.670
But why would you fake illness like that-pri?

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:43.890
I truly am very sorry, but I absolutely needed you in PriPara.

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:45.520
Needed us?

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:46.850
I wanted to show you something.

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:50.140
Eh?

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:57.780
Hi! Everyone idoling good?

00:11:57.780 --> 00:11:59.650
Yeah!

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:01.610
I'm Cosmo!

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:04.310
We cosmic know!

00:12:04.310 --> 00:12:05.410
Cosmo?

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:06.830
Sister?

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:08.790
Cosmo's performing?

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:12.860
I may not look like much up here,
but I was kind of a big shot just yesterday!

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:15.860
Designers can be idols too!

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:19.510
Let's glow like a big old Cyalume Coord tonight!

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:21.470
Cosmic eeek!

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:23.320
I can't hear you!

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:26.430
How about it? You glowing or not?

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:29.530
Let's glow!

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:35.100
Yay! Tera Cosmic yay!

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:50.480
Eh? Mom?!

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:51.750
And the headmistress.

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:52.470
Gah...

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:08.570
Making Drama Switch On!

00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:15.660
Run through!

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:20.780
Throb Cosmically!

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:35.310
Neon Light

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:37.560
Roulette!

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:41.600
Cyalume Change!

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:48.040
Cos!

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:29.610
She looks like she's having fun.

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:32.300
Incredible! It's like she's become one with the audience!

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:34.280
Wow! So cool!

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:36.990
Thank you! Cos-Cosmic Happy!

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:40.300
Never forget your friends are with you!

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:42.240
Never give up-glo!

00:15:46.530 --> 00:15:48.770
This is what a concert's all about!

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:50.420
I feel much better.

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:52.190
The audience is on fire!

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:53.580
I got goosebumps!

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:54.780
Me too!

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:55.890
Glad to hear it.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:16:03.100
This special concert was planned by Cosmo, Gloria, Lala's mother, and...

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:06.210
everyone here.

00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:08.790
You guys!

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:10.740
We helped set things up.

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:11.490
Chanko!

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.030
As did I.

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:17.120
I hope to see Dressing Pafé on stage again.

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:19.510
We're all your fans!

00:16:19.510 --> 00:16:21.560
Get back into the groove soon!

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:23.100
Lovely!

00:16:25.110 --> 00:16:26.000
Capisce!

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.250
Right! That's what was missing!

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:35.060
Caring for the fans who support you could be more important than victory alone.

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:38.210
Exactly right-pri. I was sorely mistaken-pri.

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:40.600
We'll work even harder than before!

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:44.440
Spirits lifted! Let's get back to performing!

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:46.200
That's the spirit-usa!

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:48.440
Dressing Pafé is the number one group-usa!

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:50.690
SoLaMi SMILE is number one-kuma!

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:51.940
Get off me-usa!

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:53.860
Get some of this!

00:16:53.860 --> 00:17:00.560
Uh, Falulu's Paradise Coord Reveal Show is about to start...

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:01.620
Oh yeah!

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:04.860
Thank you for coming today!

00:17:04.860 --> 00:17:07.250
All eyes on the shining Coord!

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:11.460
Falulu's Paradise Coord Reveal Show is starting!

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:20.560
You all will be witnesses to the previously unseen miracle of the Paradise Coord shining!

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:27.010
This is a miracle Falulu alone can make happen!

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:28.890
Let's start!

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:31.680
Go get 'em, Falulu!

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:34.530
Look over here Falulu!

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:35.860
Falulu is love!

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:37.920
You're the cutest, Falulu!

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:41.250
Unicorn said all an idol needs is fans.

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:11.880
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:15.070
Believe

00:19:20.920 --> 00:19:22.390
in Dreams.

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:29.710
Frozen Castle

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:43.180
Mirage!

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:47.370
It's finally here! The shine!

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:50.100
Cyalume Change!

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:06.650
I don't see any shine.

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:08.160
No Cyalume...

00:20:08.160 --> 00:20:09.540
What's going on?

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:12.090
Wasn't she going to make a miracle happen?

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:16.360
Lights! Get those lights off!

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.040
What is it?

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:20.780
Why isn't it shining?

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:21.660
Get over here!

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:25.460
<i>Why isn't it working? Her abilities are well beyond the limits.</i>

00:20:25.970 --> 00:20:30.250
<i>Could it be the like count wasn't high enough for a miracle?</i>

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:33.080
Big old shiny fraud.

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:35.680
And didn't she just copy all those Making Dramas?

00:20:35.680 --> 00:20:36.740
What a disappointment.

00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:38.130
Let's go.

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:39.620
<i>This is bad!</i>

00:20:39.620 --> 00:20:42.340
<i>We can't lose fans over this!</i>

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:44.810
This was just a little ruse to build hype!

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:45.800
Eh?

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:50.010
Where would the fun be in the legendary Coord starting to shine so easily?

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:52.320
We're waiting for next time!

00:20:52.320 --> 00:20:57.850
<i>If we get a bunch more likes on the big stadium it should work for sure!</i>

00:20:57.850 --> 00:20:59.230
Silence, please!

